ll um you know  and i  and i keep in touch a lot yeah and you  are you guys kind of bonding over the  mom thing now you have that in common  yeah yeah yeah yeah yeah like we've  taken our kids to  you know the railroad park and just we  like to keep in touch and just like  you know talk about things going on in  our life  you

